@api = http://localhost:5168/api/v1/admin
@adminToken = <administrator-access-token>
@tenantId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@scopeId = <organization-or-branch-id>

# Business writes moved to Organization.Api/organization.http.
# These Identity routes expose the authorization scope directory only.

### List tenants from Organization owner
GET {{api}}/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### List authorization scope read models for a selected tenant
GET {{api}}/tenants/{{tenantId}}/scopes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### Read an authorization scope
GET {{api}}/scopes/{{scopeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
